{"title":"1.3.4.1","sourceTitle":"1.3.4.1/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/1.3.4.1/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"1.3.4.1 (100% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/1.3.4.1\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"1.3.4.1 (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/1.3.4.1/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"1.3.4.1 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div style=\"margin: 0 1em 1em; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; float:right; width:300px; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);&#125;&#125;\">\n<big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">1.3.4.1/pt-br</span></b></big></th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"margin:auto; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><b><i>\"Sandy Hotfix\"</i></b></span></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%\"><b>Release date</b></td><td>April 23, 2017</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%); height: 1.5em; text-align:center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb; margin:auto;\">Version chronology</span></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center\"><table style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%\"><a href=\"/1.2.0\" title=\"1.2.0\"><span style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">◄</span>◄ 1.2.0</a><br /><a href=\"/1.3.4\" title=\"1.3.4\">◄ 1.3.4</a></td><td><a href=\"/index.php?title=1.4.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.4.0 (page does not exist)\">1.4.0 <span style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">►</span>►</a><br /><a href=\"/1.3.5\" title=\"1.3.5\">1.3.5 ►</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n<b>1.3.4.1</b>, também conhecido como Sandy Hotfix<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>, é um pequeno hotfix com ajustes visuais e correções de bugs que quebram o jogo.\n</p><p><span id=\"Tweaks\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Ajustes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ajustes</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Jogabilidade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Jogabilidade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Geração_de_mundo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geração de mundo</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Correções\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Correções</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ajustes\">Ajustes</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Gameplay\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Jogabilidade\">Jogabilidade</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Horizonte do céu ajustado - agora assume a cor da neblina, tornando a neblina realmente nebulosa.</li>\n<li>Shaders Bloom e Godray ajustados. Particularmente o shader godray tem um céu menos superexposto agora.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"World&#95;generation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Gera.C3.A7.C3.A3o_de_mundo\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geração_de_mundo\">Geração de mundo</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Arbustos e colheitas de frutas ajustadas para aparecerem também em climas mais quentes devem ser um pouco mais comuns agora.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Fixes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Corre.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Correções\">Correções</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Corrigido ou pelo menos reduzido a ocorrência de travamento do servidor.</li>\n<li>Corrigido jogador que não conseguia mais morrer.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.vintagestory.at/blog.html/news/sandy-hotfix-1341-r81/\">\" Sandy Hotfix (1.3.4.1) \"</a>– Vintagestory.at, April 23, 2017\n</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115552\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 215/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7883/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1438/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 927/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.010/7 seconds\nLua virtual size: 4689920/52428800 bytes\nLua estimated memory usage: 0 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   20.292      1 -total\n 76.10%   15.442      1 Template:Version_info\n 72.26%   14.663      1 Template:Infobox\n  7.41%    1.503      3 Template:Infobox_row\n  1.14%    0.232      1 Template:Reference\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:169728-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111115552 and revision id 376606. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Ajustes","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"1.3.4.1/pt-br","byteoffset":480,"anchor":"Ajustes","linkAnchor":"Ajustes"},{"toclevel":2,"level":"3","line":"Jogabilidade","number":"1.1","index":"2","fromtitle":"1.3.4.1/pt-br","byteoffset":524,"anchor":"Jogabilidade","linkAnchor":"Jogabilidade"},{"toclevel":2,"level":"3","line":"Geração de mundo","number":"1.2","index":"3","fromtitle":"1.3.4.1/pt-br","byteoffset":789,"anchor":"Geração_de_mundo","linkAnchor":"Geração_de_mundo"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Correções","number":"2","index":"4","fromtitle":"1.3.4.1/pt-br","byteoffset":970,"anchor":"Correções","linkAnchor":"Correções"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Referências","number":"3","index":"5","fromtitle":"1.3.4.1/pt-br","byteoffset":1145,"anchor":"Referências","linkAnchor":"Referências"}],"revid":3